Langchain and baml (Created by Fareed Khan ) A key issue with LangChain extraction capabilities is its reliance on strict JSON parsing, which can fail even when using larger models or highly detailed prompt templates. In contrast, BAML uses a fuzzy parsing approach that can extract data even when the LLM output isn’t perfectly formatted as JSON. In this blog, we will explore the limitations of LangChain extraction when using smaller quantized models, and will see how BAML can improve extraction success rates from around 25% to over 99% . All the code is available in my GitHub Repo: -- -- 1 Follow Published in Level Up Coding 262K followers · Last published 2 days ago Coding tutorials and news. The developer homepage gitconnected.com && skilled.dev && levelup.dev Follow Written by Fareed Khan 51K followers · 0 following I write on AI, https://www.linkedin.com/in/fareed-khan-dev/ Responses ( 1 ) See all responses Help Status About Careers Press Blog Privacy Rules Terms Text to speech
